				},
				{
					"id": 733420202,
					"content": "Pari powers are quite fascinating, yes.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733420203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 733420203,
					"content": "Of course, many Pari know how to bring Sunyata Flowers to life by heart.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733420204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sorush"
				},
				{
					"id": 733420204,
					"content": "Simply put, even though the Sign of Apaosha has disappeared, this Sunyata Flower hasn't recovered from its corrosion and it's still extremely feeble...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733420205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sorush"
				},
				{
					"id": 733420205,
					"content": "The other flower ponds are unlikely to be spared. This must be very upsetting for Sefana.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733420206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sorush"
				},
				{
					"id": 733420206,
					"content": "This Sefana you mentioned must be a nice Pari who works hard to take care of the flowers!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733420207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 733420207,
					"content": "#Let's go help her, shall we, {NICKNAME}?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733420208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 733420208,
					"content": "For me, it's nothing too difficult, and it'll help out Sefana. My Yasnapati, please keep an eye out for these Sunyata Flowers.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733420209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sorush"
				},
				{
					"id": 733420209,
					"content": "I'll tell you when I see them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733420210
					]
				},
